siddump.cpp links against libsidplayfp (GPL v2 or later). It is therefore
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.

  siddump.cpp              — SID register dumper (links libsidplayfp)
  libsidplayfp-overlay/    — committed libsidplayfp headers/sources (GPL v2+)
  build.sh                 — build script (clones + builds libsidplayfp and
                             the xa65 assembler, both GPL v2, into gitignored
                             directories that are not part of this repo)

Full GPL v2 text: libsidplayfp-overlay/COPYING

The Python tooling in this directory (tools/*.py) and the rest of the
SIDfinity pipeline are MIT licensed (see ../LICENSE).
